<div id="beneficiary-panel" class="special-indicator-panel" hidden><div class="special-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">GEF #11 BENEFICIARY CATEGORIES</div><h4>People benefiting from GEF-financed investments</h4><p>Enter male and female beneficiaries by the seven role-based categories. The portal sums these values into GEF #11 and derives GEF #11.1 (male) and GEF #11.2 (female).</p></div><strong id="beneficiary-total">Total: 0</strong></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Definition</th><th>Examples</th><th>Male</th><th>Female</th><th>Total</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($beneficiaryCategories as $bc):$br=$beneficiaryExisting[$bc['id']]??[];?><tr><td><strong><?=e($bc['category_no'].'. '.$bc['name'])?></strong><input type="hidden" name="beneficiary_category_id[]" value="<?=$bc['id']?>"></td><td><?=e($bc['definition'])?></td><td><?=e($bc['examples'])?></td><td><input class="beneficiary-count male-count" data-category="<?=$bc['id']?>" type="number" min="0" step="1" name="male[<?=$bc['id']?>]" value="<?=e((string)($br['male_count']??0))?>"></td><td><input class="beneficiary-count female-count" data-category="<?=$bc['id']?>" type="number" min="0" step="1" name="female[<?=$bc['id']?>]" value="<?=e((string)($br['female_count']??0))?>"></td><td class="row-total" data-category="<?=$bc['id']?>">0</td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></div>
